    {
      "text": "the Lord has created earth and his children to possess it, 1 Ne. 17:36. God created all things in heaven and earth, 2 Ne. 2:14 (Mosiah 4:9; Alma 18:28; 22:10; Morm. 9:11). the Lord thy maker stretched forth heavens, laid foundations of earth, 2 Ne. 8:13 (Isa. 51:13). I have spoken words of your Maker, 2 Ne. 9:40. if there were no God, there could have been no creation, 2 Ne. 11:7. God has created all men, 2 Ne. 29:7. Nephites’ sins make Jacob2 shrink before his Maker, Jacob 2:6. God has created men to keep his commandments and glorify him, Jacob 2:21. earth was created by power of God’s word, Jacob 4:9. Enos2 kneels before his Maker, Enos 1:4. people of Zarahemla deny being of their Creator, Omni 1:17. God has created you and granted unto you your lives, Mosiah 2:20–23. except for interposition of all-wise Creator, people of Noah3 must remain in bondage, Mosiah 29:19. all things witness there is a Supreme Creator, Alma 30:44. God of Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob created heavens and earth, Morm. 9:11–12.",
